<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALY AND POLAND DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALY AND POLAND DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BENEVENTO, Italy 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy and Poland drew 1-1</p>
<p>(halftime 0-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>two qualifier on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Italy - Lucarelli 84</p>
<p>Poland - Szymkowiak 45</p>
<p>Attendance: 17,918</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F  A   Pts</p>
<p> Italy		  6  3  2  1 17   3  11</p>
<p> England		5  3  2  0  4   0  11</p>
<p> Poland		 4  0  3  1  3   5   3</p>
<p> Moldova		4  1  0  3  3  12   3</p>
<p> Georgia		3  0  1  2  0   7   1</p>
<p>Next match: May 30 Poland v England</p>
</text>
